    "sections": {
        "description": "Pixel Personal Portfolio Theme is designed for presenting visual projects, case studies, and professional work in a structured layout. The theme includes sections for featured projects, image galleries, service details, testimonials, and contact information. It supports responsive layouts that adjust across desktops, tablets, and mobile devices for consistent viewing. Built-in customization options allow changes to colors, typography, banners, and homepage sections without altering core files. The theme is compatible with common page builder plugins and supports social media integration for linking external profiles. Additional features include portfolio filtering, blog layouts, multiple page templates, and customizable headers and footers. Clean navigation and organized content blocks help display project details clearly. The theme also includes optimized code structure, translation readiness, and basic SEO-friendly elements to support site performance and accessibility. It can be used for creating online portfolios, showcasing completed projects, or maintaining a professional digital presence with flexible content management options."
    },
